1
00:01:44,155 --> 00:01:48,025
Well, I want something sweet to go with my tea. Oh!

2
00:01:52,329 --> 00:01:53,030
Huh?

3
00:01:53,697 --> 00:01:54,532
Good grief...

4
00:01:55,399 --> 00:01:57,802
What does he think the police station is?

5
00:01:58,836 --> 00:02:01,572
Well then, let's have these.

6
00:02:02,072 --> 00:02:04,041
Oh, Ryo-san, I found something great...

7
00:02:04,241 --> 00:02:05,242
See you later!

8
00:02:05,443 --> 00:02:08,245
I'm gonna eat daifuku!

9
00:02:11,182 --> 00:02:13,350
Ah, they were good. Oh?

10
00:02:15,586 --> 00:02:17,254
Hey, Ryotsu, good work on patrol...

11
00:02:17,688 --> 00:02:18,989
Well...

12
00:02:21,225 --> 00:02:23,260
Jeez, what a restless guy.

13
00:02:23,461 --> 00:02:24,528
Ahhh!

14
00:02:24,995 --> 00:02:29,033
No, no, no, no!

15
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:32,736
Who the hell ate my daifuku?!

16
00:02:32,937 --> 00:02:34,271
D-Daifuku?

17
00:02:34,738 --> 00:02:36,073
Th-This is bad...

18
00:02:38,042 --> 00:02:38,876
Huh?

19
00:02:40,010 --> 00:02:40,911
Chief.

20
00:02:41,145 --> 00:02:41,779
Oh?

21
00:02:42,379 --> 00:02:43,781
What are you doing, sir?

22
00:02:44,014 --> 00:02:45,783
Oh! N-Nothing!

23
00:02:46,016 --> 00:02:46,851
Chief!

24
00:02:47,952 --> 00:02:50,788
Don't you know daifuku in the kitchen?

25
00:02:51,055 --> 00:02:53,624
W-What? Daifuku? I don't know.

26
00:02:53,858 --> 00:02:55,159
Really?

27
00:02:55,392 --> 00:02:57,294
Honestly, if I don't know, I don't know!

28
00:02:57,728 --> 00:02:59,230
What on earth happened?

29
00:02:59,430 --> 00:03:02,867
Daifuku I kept in the kitchen were gone.

30
00:03:03,067 --> 00:03:05,135
Oh no, I haven't eaten them.

31
00:03:05,336 --> 00:03:07,304
I don't know anything, either.

32
00:03:07,638 --> 00:03:09,306
So, that means...

33
00:03:14,879 --> 00:03:16,480
Chief, please say "eee".

34
00:03:16,714 --> 00:03:17,515
Eh?

35
00:03:17,882 --> 00:03:21,185
Not "eh", but "eee"! Just do like this, "eee"!

36
00:03:21,418 --> 00:03:22,786
Why should I do that?

37
00:03:23,254 --> 00:03:25,055
Is there any reason you can't?

38
00:03:25,322 --> 00:03:26,790
No, there isn't.

39
00:03:26,991 --> 00:03:27,791
See?

40
00:03:29,193 --> 00:03:30,060
Hmph!

41
00:03:31,095 --> 00:03:32,997
I found bean paste crumbs!

42
00:03:33,631 --> 00:03:35,799
The culprit is you, Chief!

43
00:03:38,269 --> 00:03:39,937
How greedy!

44
00:03:40,137 --> 00:03:44,308
Eating by yourself the daifuku your subordinate was looking forward to.

45
00:03:44,508 --> 00:03:46,810
What kind of boss does that?

46
00:03:47,011 --> 00:03:51,448
You mean all food in the station is yours, huh?

47
00:03:51,649 --> 00:03:54,151
You could have left at least one,

48
00:03:54,351 --> 00:03:56,954
but you ate all of them!

49
00:03:57,154 --> 00:04:00,024
This is when a person's true nature shows, you know!

50
00:04:00,224 --> 00:04:03,093
I can't believe you, as a person.

51
00:04:03,294 --> 00:04:05,529
You really didn't have to say all that!

52
00:04:05,963 --> 00:04:07,164
That's right!

53
00:04:07,364 --> 00:04:10,968
Besides, those daifuku are the ones Reiko-san bought, aren't they?

54
00:04:11,168 --> 00:04:14,171
Yeah. It's not like they belonged to Ryo-chan.

55
00:04:17,508 --> 00:04:20,878
Oh, I'm hungry! Getting excited just makes it worse...

56
00:04:21,412 --> 00:04:26,684
After all, you ran out of money and had nothing to eat, as usual.

57
00:04:26,884 --> 00:04:28,652
You never learn, Ryotsu.

58
00:04:29,353 --> 00:04:30,788
If only those daifuku were left,

59
00:04:30,988 --> 00:04:33,958
I would have been fine for three days with one daifuku a day!

60
00:04:34,158 --> 00:04:36,794
They were worth 10,000 yen to me,

61
00:04:36,994 --> 00:04:38,963
and then, Chief...

62
00:04:39,163 --> 00:04:40,664
Oh no, Chief...

63
00:04:41,231 --> 00:04:43,667
I never thought Chief would eat them!

64
00:04:43,867 --> 00:04:46,537
I thought Chief was the only one I could trust.

65
00:04:46,737 --> 00:04:51,241
Ahh, I don't know what to believe in this world anymore.

66
00:04:51,442 --> 00:04:52,443
Oh, no, no.

67
00:04:52,676 --> 00:04:55,145
I got it! I just have to pay for daifuku, right?

68
00:04:55,746 --> 00:04:58,248
Daifuku? Ha, you don't get it.

69
00:04:58,449 --> 00:05:03,821
At this point, three daifuku won't heal the wounds in my heart.

70
00:05:04,021 --> 00:05:08,392
You always say that you think of your subordinates above all else,

71
00:05:08,592 --> 00:05:11,629
but what you're doing is totally different, huh?

72
00:05:12,262 --> 00:05:16,300
Is it okay for someone who thinks about his subordinates to let them starve?

73
00:05:16,533 --> 00:05:20,170
All right! I'll pay you 10,000 yen, including compensation!

74
00:05:20,871 --> 00:05:22,039
Really, Chief?

75
00:05:22,239 --> 00:05:25,009
Yes, but I won't give you cash right now.

76
00:05:25,209 --> 00:05:26,110
W-Why?

77
00:05:26,577 --> 00:05:31,615
Knowing you, if I give you cash, you'll blow it on fun again right away.

78
00:05:32,216 --> 00:05:33,117
You're right.

79
00:05:33,450 --> 00:05:36,453
That's Ryotsu's usual pattern.

80
00:05:37,021 --> 00:05:40,624
Th-Then, how are you gonna pay me 10,000 yen?

81
00:05:40,858 --> 00:05:42,626
With this!

82
00:05:43,594 --> 00:05:46,563
All-you-can-eat international cuisine!

83
00:05:47,564 --> 00:05:50,634
I'll cover 10,000 yen for the entrance fee.

84
00:05:50,901 --> 00:05:52,770
Yay! Now you're talking!

85
00:05:52,970 --> 00:05:54,271
Chief, let's go right now!

86
00:05:54,471 --> 00:05:55,406
You idiot, wait!

87
00:05:55,606 --> 00:05:56,607
Look here carefully.

88
00:05:57,675 --> 00:06:00,611
There are still five days until the opening!

89
00:06:02,413 --> 00:06:05,616
"FIVE DAYS LATER"

90
00:06:19,797 --> 00:06:22,666
This is the famous Sky Building 50.

91
00:06:23,333 --> 00:06:25,969
Oh, as expected, it's so crowded today.

92
00:06:26,170 --> 00:06:29,373
They've all come for the sky buffet.

93
00:06:29,606 --> 00:06:30,841
By the way, where's Ryotsu?

94
00:06:31,341 --> 00:06:33,343
He said he was too hungry to walk,

95
00:06:33,544 --> 00:06:37,347
so he was gonna come from the dorm on Honda-san's bike.

96
00:06:45,622 --> 00:06:47,658
Hey, we've arrived, Ryotsu.

97
00:06:47,858 --> 00:06:48,559
Ouch, ouch...

98
00:06:48,792 --> 00:06:50,661
I'm too hungry, ouch...

99
00:06:50,861 --> 00:06:52,396
Pathetic!

100
00:06:52,629 --> 00:06:54,298
Get it together!

101
00:06:54,498 --> 00:06:55,866
Shall we go!

102
00:06:59,536 --> 00:07:03,207
I can't believe you survived five days on just water.

103
00:07:03,407 --> 00:07:04,875
It's all for this day.

104
00:07:05,309 --> 00:07:08,879
For 10,000 yen, I'll definitely eat 100,000-yen worth of food!

105
00:07:09,113 --> 00:07:11,381
"GOAL 100,000 YEN"

106
00:07:11,882 --> 00:07:14,284
Please pay 10,000 yen!

107
00:07:14,485 --> 00:07:15,886
Okay, okay.

108
00:07:16,353 --> 00:07:17,654
Here, 10,000 yen!

109
00:07:18,288 --> 00:07:21,225
I'm sorry, but with consumption tax and other charges,

110
00:07:21,425 --> 00:07:24,394
the total will be 10,635 yen.

111
00:07:24,595 --> 00:07:26,396
What? Is this not enough?

112
00:07:26,730 --> 00:07:28,232
Too bad, Ryotsu.

113
00:07:28,432 --> 00:07:31,735
I said I'd pay exactly 10,000 yen.

114
00:07:31,969 --> 00:07:35,572
That's dirty! How's this supposed to be all-you-can-eat for 10,000 yen?

115
00:07:42,713 --> 00:07:43,914
There you go.

116
00:07:46,216 --> 00:07:49,386
Alright, I'll eat enough to make up for the tax!

117
00:08:06,470 --> 00:08:07,905
Gotta get your money's worth.

118
00:08:18,749 --> 00:08:20,551
There! There it is!

119
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:25,389
Stop it, idiot! How embarrassing!

120
00:08:25,956 --> 00:08:28,458
I'm impressed they managed to gather all of this.

121
00:08:28,792 --> 00:08:32,129
I'm so happy! I've never had any of these before.

122
00:08:32,930 --> 00:08:38,135
&lt;i&gt;Now, we have all the famous dishes&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;from around the world on this floor.&lt;/i&gt;

123
00:08:39,036 --> 00:08:40,637
&lt;i&gt;There's no time limit.&lt;/i&gt;

124
00:08:41,371 --> 00:08:43,407
Please take your time to enjoy your meal.

125
00:09:02,993 --> 00:09:03,660
Oh!

126
00:09:04,261 --> 00:09:05,662
This looks delicious.

127
00:09:10,667 --> 00:09:11,602
Ryotsu!

128
00:09:11,802 --> 00:09:14,171
If it looks good, shove others aside and eat it.

129
00:09:14,471 --> 00:09:16,306
That's my style.

130
00:09:21,178 --> 00:09:22,179
Oh, no!

131
00:09:26,283 --> 00:09:27,951
That's a lot of food.

132
00:09:28,151 --> 00:09:31,421
Of course! It's a waste of time to keep going back for more!

133
00:09:31,622 --> 00:09:33,257
There's no time limit.

134
00:09:33,457 --> 00:09:37,427
Hmph! If you don't hurry, someone else might eat your food!

135
00:09:37,628 --> 00:09:38,462
Argh!

136
00:09:43,333 --> 00:09:44,968
That's beyond human skill...

137
00:09:46,503 --> 00:09:48,906
Now, let's get in earnest!

138
00:09:49,139 --> 00:09:52,676
Ryotsu, could you come with me to the bathroom?

139
00:09:52,876 --> 00:09:56,913
What? You can't go alone? What kind of wimp are you?

140
00:09:57,147 --> 00:10:01,551
Please, I need your help. This place is so big, I might get lost.

141
00:10:01,752 --> 00:10:02,686
Hmph! Who cares?

142
00:10:02,886 --> 00:10:07,591
Come one! I brought you here, didn't I, Ryotsu?

143
00:10:09,326 --> 00:10:10,193
I can't help it.

144
00:10:11,128 --> 00:10:13,997
Listen, the good stuff disappears quickly at a buffet.

145
00:10:14,197 --> 00:10:16,300
That's the rule! Hurry up!

146
00:10:16,500 --> 00:10:18,068
Oh, one more plate.

147
00:10:20,070 --> 00:10:20,704
What?

148
00:10:24,474 --> 00:10:25,876
No, we can't put out the fire!

149
00:10:26,076 --> 00:10:27,577
There's no other way.

150
00:10:29,012 --> 00:10:32,416
Hurry! Please evacuate everyone from the building!

151
00:10:33,216 --> 00:10:33,917
I got it.

152
00:10:34,351 --> 00:10:37,487
&lt;i&gt;Everyone, please stay calm&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;and listen carefully.&lt;/i&gt;

153
00:10:38,622 --> 00:10:42,592
&lt;i&gt;We have an emergency situation&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;in this building.&lt;/i&gt;

154
00:10:43,493 --> 00:10:44,928
An emergency situation?

155
00:10:46,063 --> 00:10:50,934
A fire has been reported at the thermal power plant on the 35th floor.

156
00:10:51,501 --> 00:10:53,370
Th-The thermal power plant?

157
00:10:53,570 --> 00:10:55,205
Why would they even have that?

158
00:10:55,906 --> 00:11:00,210
&lt;i&gt;There's no immediate danger&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;at the moment, but as a precaution,&lt;/i&gt;

159
00:11:00,410 --> 00:11:03,714
&lt;i&gt;please leave your food as it is&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;and evacuate calmly.&lt;/i&gt;

160
00:11:04,514 --> 00:11:06,216
This is a serious situation.

161
00:11:06,416 --> 00:11:07,084
Yes.

162
00:11:07,451 --> 00:11:10,253
We'll cooperate and guide people to evacuate.

163
00:11:10,454 --> 00:11:13,290
Everyone, stay calm and don't panic.

164
00:11:13,990 --> 00:11:16,360
Line up calmly for the elevator!

165
00:11:19,663 --> 00:11:23,467
No need to rush. There's enough time, so stay calm!

166
00:11:28,572 --> 00:11:29,673
Sorry, Ryotsu.

167
00:11:30,140 --> 00:11:32,476
Too late! I've eaten two plates of food.

168
00:11:32,676 --> 00:11:34,444
Let's go back! Hurry up!

169
00:11:38,582 --> 00:11:40,117
We're the last ones left.

170
00:11:40,317 --> 00:11:42,953
Thank you very much for your cooperation.

171
00:11:47,958 --> 00:11:51,094
Now, this elevator will be closed.

172
00:11:52,796 --> 00:11:53,663
What?

173
00:12:11,348 --> 00:12:15,018
By the way, I didn't see Ryotsu and Honda-san around.

174
00:12:15,252 --> 00:12:18,455
Hmph, knowing those guys, they were probably the first to run off.

175
00:12:19,122 --> 00:12:23,026
Seriously, they've got no business wearing a police badge.

176
00:12:23,260 --> 00:12:25,462
Did they really run off and leave their food behind?

177
00:12:26,263 --> 00:12:26,997
Huh?

178
00:12:31,168 --> 00:12:32,436
It's over! Get out of here!

179
00:12:32,636 --> 00:12:34,738
Damn it! Evacuate now!

180
00:12:43,814 --> 00:12:44,614
Huh?

181
00:12:44,815 --> 00:12:45,715
Ah? Oh?

182
00:12:46,850 --> 00:12:49,986
What's this building? It's like a maze.

183
00:12:50,187 --> 00:12:51,855
Ryotsu, this way!

184
00:12:52,923 --> 00:12:55,358
Hurry up! The food is running out!

185
00:12:55,725 --> 00:12:57,327
If it's gone, it's your fault!

186
00:12:57,527 --> 00:12:58,695
Then, prepare yourself...

187
00:12:58,895 --> 00:12:59,629
-What? -Huh?

188
00:13:00,397 --> 00:13:02,632
What? There's no one here.

189
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:05,202
Has everyone gone home?

190
00:13:05,402 --> 00:13:06,636
I-It's true...

191
00:13:07,938 --> 00:13:11,107
Well, never mind. Now's the time! Right, let's eat!

192
00:13:11,508 --> 00:13:13,543
Yay, It's all-you-can-take!

193
00:13:57,153 --> 00:13:57,787
Was he here?

194
00:13:57,988 --> 00:13:58,788
He's not here.

195
00:13:58,989 --> 00:14:00,090
He's not anywhere.

196
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,594
That means...

197
00:14:05,362 --> 00:14:07,063
he's still in there...

198
00:14:13,837 --> 00:14:16,973
Start with the expensive stuff, like foie gras and caviar.

199
00:14:17,174 --> 00:14:18,241
Sure.

200
00:14:18,575 --> 00:14:20,110
Don't you think it's smoky?

201
00:14:20,310 --> 00:14:23,480
Now that you mention it, yeah. Maybe some attraction outside.

202
00:14:23,713 --> 00:14:25,482
Well, maybe so.

203
00:14:25,715 --> 00:14:26,316
Hmm?

204
00:14:26,850 --> 00:14:29,486
I'm enjoying my meal here! What the heck?

205
00:14:29,753 --> 00:14:30,787
Yes, hello?

206
00:14:30,987 --> 00:14:31,821
&lt;i&gt;Ryotsu!&lt;/i&gt;

207
00:14:33,089 --> 00:14:36,560
&lt;i&gt;You startled me! Is that you, Chief?&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;Why did you leave early?&lt;/i&gt;

208
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:38,428
Okay, Ryotsu. Listen carefully!

209
00:14:38,628 --> 00:14:41,565
There's a fire on the 35th floor of that building.

210
00:14:42,098 --> 00:14:43,466
&lt;i&gt;That building is on fire!&lt;/i&gt;

211
00:14:44,501 --> 00:14:48,638
Come on, Chief. I won't be fooled by such a lie.

212
00:14:48,838 --> 00:14:49,973
&lt;i&gt;It's not a lie!&lt;/i&gt;

213
00:14:50,173 --> 00:14:54,611
Chief, I paid 635 yen for this.

214
00:14:55,579 --> 00:14:57,781
I'll eat exactly 100,000 yen's worth before leaving.

215
00:14:57,981 --> 00:14:59,816
You just tried to scare me...

216
00:15:00,016 --> 00:15:00,817
Hmm?

217
00:15:04,955 --> 00:15:07,490
Wow! There's really a fire!

218
00:15:08,825 --> 00:15:11,461
You two are the only ones left in the building.

219
00:15:11,661 --> 00:15:13,330
Everyone else has already evacuated.

220
00:15:13,530 --> 00:15:17,601
Ryotsu, it's scary! We'll turn into yakitori!

221
00:15:17,801 --> 00:15:20,337
&lt;i&gt;You two stay calm&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;and listen to me carefully.&lt;/i&gt;

222
00:15:20,870 --> 00:15:22,639
The elevators are no longer usable.

223
00:15:22,839 --> 00:15:25,875
Wait calmly until we head to rescue you.

224
00:15:26,076 --> 00:15:28,812
Do you understand, Ryotsu? Don't act on your own!

225
00:15:29,145 --> 00:15:31,181
Argh, we're trapped!

226
00:15:31,381 --> 00:15:34,517
Don't panic, Honda! That's embarrassing!

227
00:15:35,685 --> 00:15:36,553
Wait a minute.

228
00:15:36,786 --> 00:15:40,323
W-Where are you going, Ryotsu? Don't leave me alone!

229
00:15:40,657 --> 00:15:43,259
First, secure the extinguishers.

230
00:15:48,064 --> 00:15:51,234
Close the fire shutters, and the fire won't come in for now.

231
00:15:51,468 --> 00:15:53,470
In the meantime, we'll eat.

232
00:15:53,670 --> 00:15:56,273
Are you still gonna eat in this situation?

233
00:15:56,806 --> 00:15:59,876
I came here to eat 100,000 yen's worth!

234
00:16:00,076 --> 00:16:02,178
I paid as much as 635 yen!

235
00:16:02,846 --> 00:16:05,181
I'm gonna eat them no matter what!

236
00:16:08,285 --> 00:16:11,187
Live from the Sky Building fire scene.

237
00:16:11,588 --> 00:16:13,690
Two people are still inside.

238
00:16:14,557 --> 00:16:16,860
Oh, just now, we've spotted them.

239
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:19,229
He's actually eating!

240
00:16:19,963 --> 00:16:23,266
Unbelievable. Ryotsu is smiling while eating!

241
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:27,137
Ryotsu doesn't let anything faze him.

242
00:16:42,419 --> 00:16:45,221
Chief, what was that explosion?

243
00:16:45,422 --> 00:16:47,524
&lt;i&gt;The gas station&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;two floors below exploded.&lt;/i&gt;

244
00:16:47,724 --> 00:16:50,794
What? Why the hell would a building have something like that?

245
00:16:56,066 --> 00:16:58,601
Oh, the electrical system's screwed up, damn it!

246
00:16:59,302 --> 00:17:02,072
Ah, go out! Go out already!

247
00:17:02,939 --> 00:17:05,875
The fire is spreading faster. Eat quickly!

248
00:17:06,076 --> 00:17:07,811
I can't eat!

249
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:12,649
Ah, the fire shutters!

250
00:17:12,882 --> 00:17:14,818
Don't make a fuss every time!

251
00:17:17,821 --> 00:17:20,023
This will do for now.

252
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:25,962
Go out, go out...

253
00:17:30,266 --> 00:17:32,602
Shut up! I can't eat in peace, seriously.

254
00:17:33,136 --> 00:17:34,104
Okay, next.

255
00:17:34,304 --> 00:17:38,041
Go out! Go out! Just go out already! Ahh!

256
00:17:48,184 --> 00:17:50,453
Ah! Come on! Waaah!

257
00:17:50,653 --> 00:17:54,224
Hurry up and help us!

258
00:17:55,992 --> 00:17:58,394
This meat's almost done...

259
00:18:00,697 --> 00:18:02,599
Yeah, it's cooked just right.

260
00:18:05,535 --> 00:18:07,837
It's no use! We're out of extinguisher fluid!

261
00:18:08,037 --> 00:18:09,839
Is there anything in the kitchen?

262
00:18:11,207 --> 00:18:11,841
Oh!

263
00:18:12,542 --> 00:18:13,843
I found good ones.

264
00:18:16,012 --> 00:18:18,248
Honda! Bring more soup!

265
00:18:19,416 --> 00:18:23,553
Okay, it's a bit wasteful, but this will stop the fire. Take that!

266
00:18:25,321 --> 00:18:27,724
You idiot! This is oil!

267
00:18:28,625 --> 00:18:29,526
I don't care anymore!

268
00:18:29,726 --> 00:18:31,494
Are you still gonna eat?

269
00:18:31,694 --> 00:18:32,829
&lt;i&gt;Ryotsu, can you hear me?&lt;/i&gt;

270
00:18:34,964 --> 00:18:37,267
The rescue helicopter is heading for the rooftop.

271
00:18:37,500 --> 00:18:39,636
Emergency stairs are at the back of the kitchen.

272
00:18:39,836 --> 00:18:42,839
You can get to the rooftop from there. Head there now.

273
00:18:44,374 --> 00:18:45,875
Yes! We're saved!

274
00:18:46,075 --> 00:18:48,244
Damn, I still haven't had enough!

275
00:18:48,445 --> 00:18:50,346
Then, I'll take everything!

276
00:18:51,714 --> 00:18:53,850
Forget the food! Let's just get out of here!

277
00:18:54,284 --> 00:18:55,351
Shut up!

278
00:18:57,020 --> 00:18:57,854
Is it here?

279
00:18:59,022 --> 00:18:59,889
Ah...

280
00:19:03,226 --> 00:19:04,694
Oh no, the fire!

281
00:19:04,894 --> 00:19:07,063
Whatever! We're breaking through!

282
00:19:09,265 --> 00:19:11,301
Here we go!

283
00:19:15,472 --> 00:19:16,840
Whoaa... Huh?

284
00:19:17,574 --> 00:19:19,609
Wait a sec! I forgot the dessert I paid tax on...

285
00:19:19,843 --> 00:19:21,077
Let's just get out of here!

286
00:19:27,083 --> 00:19:29,319
I hope Ryo-chan and Honda-san are okay...

287
00:19:37,393 --> 00:19:38,795
What? Th-This is...

288
00:19:46,502 --> 00:19:48,805
Hot, hot, hot...!

289
00:19:49,639 --> 00:19:53,977
By the way, there's a World Fireworks Expo on the rooftop. Be careful.

290
00:19:54,177 --> 00:19:55,812
Why at a time like this?

291
00:20:03,052 --> 00:20:07,323
"WORLD FIREWORKS FESTIVAL"

292
00:20:18,668 --> 00:20:20,670
We can't get closer with this heat!

293
00:20:20,904 --> 00:20:22,171
Jump over from there!

294
00:20:22,639 --> 00:20:25,775
What! After all the trouble of bringing them up here,

295
00:20:25,975 --> 00:20:27,210
do we have to leave them?

296
00:20:27,443 --> 00:20:29,145
Hurry up! Hurry!

297
00:20:29,345 --> 00:20:31,314
Ugh, there's no choice now!

298
00:20:32,615 --> 00:20:33,683
Are you gonna bring them?

299
00:20:33,917 --> 00:20:35,218
Of course!

300
00:20:37,120 --> 00:20:38,855
Caviar in the pockets!

301
00:20:39,489 --> 00:20:40,924
Escargot in the pants!

302
00:20:45,461 --> 00:20:48,665
Alright, these are worth exactly 100,000 yen!

303
00:20:49,165 --> 00:20:51,834
Can you really jump like that?

304
00:20:52,035 --> 00:20:53,636
Nothing is impossible for me!

305
00:20:53,836 --> 00:20:55,104
Okay, Honda, you go first!

306
00:20:55,305 --> 00:20:56,406
What? Eh...

307
00:21:02,111 --> 00:21:02,712
Hurry up!

308
00:21:02,946 --> 00:21:04,881
No, y-yes!

309
00:21:15,491 --> 00:21:17,126
No, I can't.

310
00:21:18,061 --> 00:21:19,662
You're hopeless.

311
00:21:20,063 --> 00:21:22,332
Fine, I'll do it myself!

312
00:21:22,532 --> 00:21:24,267
-No, no! Please don't! Stop... -Take this!

313
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:32,275
Okay! Now, it's your turn!

314
00:21:32,709 --> 00:21:34,577
Leave that food behind!

315
00:21:34,811 --> 00:21:37,280
No! I can jump this far!

316
00:21:45,555 --> 00:21:47,290
-He'll fall! -Ryo-chan!

317
00:21:52,462 --> 00:21:54,430
Yes, I'm holding on somehow.

318
00:21:55,431 --> 00:21:56,566
But it's heavy...

319
00:21:58,001 --> 00:22:00,570
It's gonna snap! Drop that food now!

320
00:22:00,837 --> 00:22:03,039
No! I can't do that!

321
00:22:03,473 --> 00:22:06,175
There's no way he can make it carrying that much food!

322
00:22:06,376 --> 00:22:09,045
This is where true character shows.

323
00:22:09,946 --> 00:22:13,549
Are you gonna give up your life for food, Ryotsu?

324
00:22:16,185 --> 00:22:17,220
Whoa!

325
00:22:19,122 --> 00:22:20,256
Ah...!

326
00:22:32,268 --> 00:22:33,069
Ah!

327
00:22:33,403 --> 00:22:34,404
He finally fell!

328
00:22:36,039 --> 00:22:40,977
Damn it! It's frustrating... but I have no choice!

329
00:22:49,452 --> 00:22:51,921
He's using the tablecloth as a parachute!

330
00:22:52,121 --> 00:22:53,923
That's beyond human skill.

331
00:23:13,076 --> 00:23:14,010
-Ryotsu! -Ryo-chan!

332
00:23:14,243 --> 00:23:15,344
Ryotsu!

333
00:23:19,115 --> 00:23:20,349
Damn it all...

334
00:23:21,184 --> 00:23:24,353
The escargot, the lobster...

335
00:23:24,554 --> 00:23:28,825
I brought them all the way, but they all fell apart!

336
00:23:29,625 --> 00:23:32,829
I haven't eaten 10,000 yen's worth yet...

337
00:23:33,329 --> 00:23:36,999
Looks like this guy values food more than his life.

338
00:23:37,200 --> 00:23:41,170
Chief, give me money again! Take me to a buffet!

339
00:23:41,370 --> 00:23:42,839
I don't care, you idiot!

340
00:23:43,039 --> 00:23:46,042
Argh, I'll eat 100,000 yen's worth!

341
00:23:46,275 --> 00:23:49,011
-What's your relationship with him? -I'll eat 100,000 yen's worth!

342
00:23:49,545 --> 00:23:52,815
I'm gonna eat!

343
00:24:02,992 --> 00:24:08,798
REIJI SHIRATORI RETURNS!
